zh:{h:n=>`影岛美食${n}家`,sub:"釜山哪里？人气排序 · ★ NAVER评分",subApi:"韩国观光公社数据 · 按离路线远近排序",pin:"地图上的绿点＝路线附近餐厅",srcApi:d=>`来源：韩国观光公社 TourAPI，${d}更新。每天早上自动更新。无评分数据。`,all:"全部",near:"路线附近",more:n=>`再看${n}家`,less:"收起",rev:"条评价",
 src:"来源：釜山哪里？(busan-where.com) 影岛美食列表，截至2026年11月23日。“路线附近”按店铺介绍中的街区大致判断。介绍为韩语。",
 cat:{cafe:"咖啡·甜点",sea:"海鲜·生鱼片",kr:"韩餐",pork:"猪肉汤饭",west:"西餐",jp:"日料·寿司",cn:"中餐",bakery:"面包店",mil:"小麦冷面",snack:"小吃",chick:"炸鸡·披萨",bar:"酒馆"},
 badge:{safe:"安心餐厅",model:"模范餐厅",bib:"必比登推介"}}};
// 가게 소개에 나온 동네 → 대략적인 위치 (앞에서부터 먼저 맞는 것)
const FAREA=[[/흰여울|영선|절영/,[35.0785,129.0445]],[/남항대교/,[35.0830,129.0420]],[/남항/,[35.0890,129.0400]],[/영도대교|대교동/,[35.0935,129.0365]],
 [/봉래/,[35.0915,129.0420]],[/신선/,[35.0850,129.0470]],[/청학수변/,[35.0905,129.0660]],[/청학/,[35.0920,129.0600]],[/태종대/,[35.0600,129.0820]],[/동삼/,[35.0750,129.0720]]];
function foodNear(f,r){
  // foods.json에서 받은 가게는 실제 좌표(f.ll), 기본 목록은 소개에 나온 동네 위치로 계산
  const ll=f.ll||(FAREA.find(([re])=>re.test(f.d||""))||[])[1];if(!ll)return null;
  let best=null;r.sim.stops.forEach((st,i)=>{const d=distM(ll,COORD[st.p.id]);if(!best||d<best.d)best={d,i,p:st.p}});
  return best&&best.d<=800?{...best,walk:Math.max(2,Math.round(best.d*1.3/70))}:null;
}
function foodHTML(r){
  const L=state.lang,F=FT[L],zones=new Set(r.chosen.map(p=>p.zone).filter(z=>z==="E"||z==="W"));
  const cats=FCAT_ORDER.filter(c=>FOOD.some(f=>f.c===c)).map(c=>[c,FOOD.filter(f=>f.c===c).length]);
  const list=FOOD.filter(f=>state.foodCat==="all"||f.c===state.foodCat).map(f=>({...f,nr:foodNear(f,r)}))
    .sort((a,b)=>(!!b.nr-!!a.nr)||((a.nr?.i??0)-(b.nr?.i??0))||((a.nr?.d??0)-(b.nr?.d??0))||(a.i-b.i));
  const LIMIT=8,shown=state.foodMore?list:list.slice(0,LIMIT);
  const kk=L==="ko"?"카카오맵":"KakaoMap",nv=L==="ko"?"네이버 지도":"NAVER Map";
  const item=f=>{const q=encodeURIComponent("부산 영도 "+f.n);return `<li class="fd">
    <span class="nm"><strong>${esc(f.n)}</strong>${f.nr?`<span class="nearb"><span class="num">${f.nr.i+1}</span>${esc(ADT[L].nearOf(f.nr.p.name[L].split(" (")[0].split("（")[0]))} · ${ADT[L].walkN(f.nr.walk)}</span>`:""}</span>
    <span class="meta"><span>${F.cat[f.c]}</span>${f.r?`<span><span class="st">★ ${f.r.toFixed(1)}</span> (${F.rev} ${f.rv.toLocaleString()})</span>`:""}${f.b.map(b=>`<span class="fbadge">${F.badge[b]}</span>`).join("")}</span>
    <span class="ds">${esc(f.d)}</span>
    <span class="maps"><a href="${f.ll?`https://map.kakao.com/link/map/${encodeURIComponent(f.n)},${f.ll[0]},${f.ll[1]}`:`https://map.kakao.com/link/search/${q}`}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">${kk}</a><a href="https://map.naver.com/p/search/${q}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">${nv}</a></span></li>`};
  return `<h2 style="font-size:19px">${F.h(FOOD.length)}</h2><p class="muted">${foodSrc==="api"?F.subApi:F.sub}${nearFoodsLL(r).length?` · ${F.pin}`:""}</p>
    <div class="fcats" role="group" aria-label="${esc(F.h(FOOD.length))}">${[["all",FOOD.length]].concat(cats).map(([c,n])=>`<button type="button" id="fcat-${c}" data-fc="${c}" aria-pressed="${state.foodCat===c}">${c==="all"?F.all:F.cat[c]} ${n}</button>`).join("")}</div>
    <ol class="flist">${shown.map(item).join("")}</ol>
    ${list.length>LIMIT?`<button type="button" class="fmore" id="foodMore">${state.foodMore?F.less:F.more(list.length-LIMIT)}</button>`:""}
    <p class="demo" style="text-align:left">${foodSrc==="api"?F.srcApi(foodUpdated):F.src}</p>`;
}
/* ---------- 매일 바뀌는 맛집 목록 불러오기 ----------
   foods.json: GitHub Actions가 매일 새벽 한국관광공사 TourAPI에서 영도 음식점을 받아 만들어 두는 파일
   (scripts/fetch-foods.mjs). 형태: {updated, items:[{id,name,cat,addr,lat,lng,tel}]}
   불러오지 못하면 위의 기본 목록(FOOD, 부산어디? 58곳)을 그대로 씁니다. */
const FOOD_API="foods.json";
let foodSrc="sample",foodUpdated="",lastR=null,kFoods=[];
function nearFoodsLL(r){
  return FOOD.filter(f=>f.ll).map(f=>({f,nr:foodNear(f,r)})).filter(x=>x.nr).sort((a,b)=>a.nr.d-b.nr.d).slice(0,15);
}
function foodSvg(r){
  return nearFoodsLL(r).map(({f})=>{const [x,y]=proj(...f.ll);
    return `<g transform="translate(${x} ${y}) scale(${(1/ZK).toFixed(3)})"><title>${esc(f.n)}</title><circle r="5.5" fill="#2f8a5b" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.8"/></g>`}).join("");
}
function drawKakaoFoods(r){
  kFoods.forEach(o=>o.setMap(null));kFoods=[];if(!kmapObj)return;const K=kakao.maps;
  nearFoodsLL(r).forEach(({f})=>kFoods.push(new K.CustomOverlay({map:kmapObj,position:new K.LatLng(...f.ll),yAnchor:.5,zIndex:0,
    content:`<div title="${esc(f.n)}" style="width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:#2f8a5b;border:2px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.35)"></div>`})));
}
async function loadFoods(){
  try{
    const ctl=new AbortController();setTimeout(()=>ctl.abort(),5000);
    const res=await fetch(FOOD_API+"?v="+Date.now(),{signal:ctl.signal});if(!res.ok)return;
    const j=await res.json();const rows=Array.isArray(j)?j:(j&&j.items);if(!Array.isArray(rows))return;
    const items=rows.map((x,i)=>{const la=+x.lat,ln=+x.lng;return {i,n:String(x.name||"").trim(),c:FCAT_ORDER.includes(x.cat)?x.cat:"kr",d:String(x.addr||""),r:null,rv:null,b:[],z:null,
      ll:(la>35&&la<35.2&&ln>128.9&&ln<129.2)?[la,ln]:null}}).filter(f=>f.n);
    if(items.length<10)return;
    FOOD=items;foodSrc="api";foodUpdated=String(j.updated||"").slice(0,10);
    if(state.foodCat!=="all"&&!FOOD.some(f=>f.c===state.foodCat))state.foodCat="all";
    if(state.screen==="result"&&lastR){const sec=document.getElementById("foodSec");if(sec){sec.innerHTML=foodHTML(lastR);wireFood(lastR)}refreshMap(lastR);if(kmapObj)drawKakaoFoods(lastR)}
  }catch(e){}
}
function wireFood(r){
  const sec=document.getElementById("foodSec");if(!sec)return;
  sec.querySelectorAll("[data-fc]").forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{state.foodCat=b.dataset.fc;state.foodMore=false;sec.innerHTML=foodHTML(r);wireFood(r)});
  const m=document.getElementById("foodMore");
  if(m)m.onclick=()=>{state.foodMore=!state.foodMore;sec.innerHTML=foodHTML(r);wireFood(r);if(!state.foodMore)sec.scrollIntoView({block:"start"})};
}

function legHTML(lg,x){
  const m=k=>{const v=lg[k];const on=lg.mode===k;return `<span class="mode${on?" on":""}">${x.modes[k]} ${v===null?"—":v+x.min}</span>`};
  return `<div class="leg"><div class="modes">${m("walk")}${m("taxi")}${m("bus")}</div><span class="move"><b>${x.recLbl} ${x.modes[lg.mode]}</b> · ${x.why[lg.why]}</span></div>`;
}
function fmtDur(m,L){const h=Math.floor(m/60),n=m%60;
  if(L==="en")return (h?h+" h ":"")+(n?n+" min":"").trim();
  if(L==="ja")return (h?h+"時間":"")+(n?n+"分":"");
  if(L==="zh")return (h?h+"小时":"")+(n?n+"分钟":"");
  return (h?h+"시간 ":"")+(n?n+"분":"");}
function renderResult(s,a){
  const x=t(),r=plan(),L=state.lang;
  const ordKey=r.ord.includes("O")?"O":r.ord.join("");
  const ids=r.chosen.map(p=>p.id);
  const rnd=seeded([state.a.nat,state.a.age,state.a.comp,state.a.weather,state.a.interests.slice().sort().join(),ids.join()].join("|"));
  const n=40+Math.floor(rnd()*150),pct=48+Math.floor(rnd()*27),rate=(4.3+rnd()*0.5).toFixed(1);
  const intNames=state.a.interests.map(k=>x.int[k]).join(", ");
  const reasons=[x.r.int(intNames)];
  const W=state.a.weather;
  if(W&&W!=="sun"){
    reasons.push(x.r[W]);
    const cut=(WX_BLOCK[W]||[]).map(id=>PLACES.find(p=>p.id===id)).filter(Boolean).map(p=>p.name[L].split(" (")[0].split("（")[0]);
    if(cut.length&&x.wxCut[W])reasons.push(x.wxCut[W](cut.join(", ")));
    if(x.wxTip[W])reasons.push(x.wxTip[W]);
  }
  const hasStairsSkip=(state.a.age==="a70"||state.a.age==="a50")&&!ids.includes("huinnyeoul");
  if(hasStairsSkip)reasons.push(x.r.stairs);
  if(state.a.comp==="family"&&ids.includes("museum"))reasons.push(x.r.family);
  if(crowdOf(r.c.pax)==="high"&&ids.includes("taejongdae")&&ids.includes("museum"))reasons.push(x.r.crowd);
  if(ids.includes("daiso")||ids.includes("oliveyoung"))reasons.push(x.r.shopYd);
  if(ids.includes("lotte"))reasons.push(x.r.beauty);
  if(r.none)reasons.unshift(x.r.tooShort);else if(r.free<=150)reasons.push(x.r.short);
  if(r.chosen.some(p=>p.meal))reasons.push(x.r.meal);
  if(r.ord.length>1&&!r.ord.includes("O"))reasons.push(x.r.oneWay);

  const prof=[x.nat[state.a.nat],x.age[state.a.age],x.comp[state.a.comp],state.a.weather?x.wx[state.a.weather]:null].filter(Boolean).map(v=>`<span class="chip">${esc(v)}</span>`).join("")+state.a.interests.map(k=>`<span class="chip">${esc(x.int[k])}</span>`).join("");
  let tl=`<li class="tl"><span class="t">${hm(r.start)}</span><span class="rail"><span class="dot end"></span><span class="line"></span></span><div class="body"><strong>${x.disembark}</strong><span class="d">${r.c.name}</span></div></li>`;
  const nearAll=nearAds(r);
  r.sim.stops.forEach((st,i)=>{
    tl+=`<li class="tl"><span class="t">${hm(st.at)}</span><span class="rail"><span class="dot"></span><span class="line"></span></span><div class="body">
      ${legHTML(st.lg,x)}
      <strong>${i+1}. ${esc(st.p.name[L])}${st.p.out?`<span class="tag-out">${x.outside}</span>`:""}</strong>
      <span class="rt" aria-label="${x.rtAria} ${placeRating(st.p.id).avg}/5"><span class="st">★</span> ${placeRating(st.p.id).avg} <small>(${placeRating(st.p.id).n})</small></span>
      <span class="d"><span class="envb ${ENV[st.p.id]||"out"}">${x.env[ENV[st.p.id]||"out"]}</span> ${esc(st.p.d[L])} · ${st.p.dwell}${x.min}</span>
      ${mapLinks(st.p,L)}
      ${state.adsOn?(()=>{const g=nearAll.filter(v=>v.i===i);return g.length?`<span class="adnear"><b>${ADT[L].nearStop}</b>${g.map(v=>`<button type="button" data-ad="${v.a.id}"><span class="dot"></span>${esc(adName(v.a,L))} · ${ADT[L].walkN(v.walk)}</button>`).join("")}</span>`:""})():""}</div></li>`;
  });
  tl+=`<li class="tl"><span class="t">${hm(r.sim.end)}</span><span class="rail"><span class="dot end"></span></span><div class="body">${legHTML(r.sim.backLeg,x)}<strong>${x.terminal}</strong></div></li>`;

  const fb=state.fbSent?`<p style="color:var(--good);font-size:14px">${x.fbThanks}</p>`:`
    <div class="stars">${[1,2,3,4,5].map(i=>`<button type="button" id="star-${i}" data-s="${i}" aria-pressed="${state.rating>=i}" aria-label="${i}/5">★</button>`).join("")}</div>
    <label class="f" for="fbLong">${x.fbLong}<select id="fbLong">${r.chosen.map(p=>`<option value="${p.id}">${esc(p.name[L])}</option>`).join("")}</select></label>
    <label class="f" for="fbText">${x.fbText}<textarea id="fbText" style="min-height:64px"></textarea></label>
    <button class="btn sea" id="fbSave" type="button" ${state.rating?"":"disabled"}>${x.fbSave}</button>`;

  s.innerHTML=`
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
    <p class="muted">${x.resultT} · ${state.cdate&&ALLC.length?(()=>{const x=new Date(state.cdate+"T00:00"),D=DT[L];return D.fmt(x.getMonth()+1,x.getDate(),D.wd[x.getDay()])+" · "})():""}${esc(r.c.name)} · ${hmD(r.c.arr)}–${hmD(r.c.dep)}</p>
    <div class="course-name">${x.course[ordKey]}</div>
    ${W&&W!=="sun"?(()=>{const c={in:0,semi:0,out:0};r.chosen.forEach(p=>c[ENV[p.id]||"out"]++);return `<div class="wxbar ${W}"><b>${x.wxDay} · ${esc(x.wx[W])}</b><span>${x.env.in} ${c.in}${x.cnt} · ${x.env.semi} ${c.semi}${x.cnt} · ${x.env.out} ${c.out}${x.cnt}</span></div>`})():""}
    <div class="chips">${prof}</div>
  </div>
  ${state.aiNote?`<div class="ainote"><b>${x.aiSays}</b><br>${esc(state.aiNote)}</div>`:""}
  ${state.aiMsg&&!state.aiNote?`<p class="muted">${esc(state.aiMsg)}</p>`:""}
  <div class="alert" role="note"><span>${x.leaveBy} <strong>${hmD(r.sim.leave)}</strong> · ${x.returnBy} <strong>${hmD(r.allAboard)}</strong></span><span class="muted">${x.alertP} (${x.dep} ${hmD(r.c.dep)})</span>${(()=>{const sp=r.allAboard-r.sim.end;return !r.none&&sp>=20?`<span class="spare"><b>${x.spare(fmtDur(sp,L))}</b> ${x.spareTip}</span>`:""})()}</div>
  <section class="mapbox" aria-label="map">
    <div id="kmap"></div>
    <div id="smap">${sketchMap(r)}</div>
    <div class="map-cap"><span id="mapCap">${MAPT[L].sketch}</span><span style="display:flex;gap:6px"><button type="button" class="adtoggle" id="zoomToggle" style="color:var(--sea)">${state.mapFull?MAPT[L].zoom:MAPT[L].full}</button><button type="button" class="adtoggle" id="adToggle" aria-pressed="${state.adsOn}"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1" y="1" width="22" height="22" rx="5" fill="currentColor"/></svg>${ADT[L].toggle}</button></span></div>
  </section>
  <div id="adPanel">${adPanelHTML(r)}</div>
  <ol class="timeline">${tl}</ol>
  <section class="card" id="foodSec">${foodHTML(r)}</section>
  <p class="muted" style="margin-top:-8px">${x.rtSrc} ${x.modeNote}</p>
  <section class="card">
    <h2 style="font-size:19px">${x.statsT}</h2>
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat"><div class="n">${n}</div><div class="l">${x.sN}</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="n">${pct}%</div><div class="l">${x.sPct}</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="n">${rate}</div><div class="l">${x.sRate} / 5</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="meter" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:${pct}%"></i></div>
  </section>
  <section class="card">
    <h2 style="font-size:19px">${x.whyT}</h2>
    <ul class="reasons">${reasons.map(v=>`<li>${esc(v)}</li>`).join("")}</ul>
  </section>
  <section class="card" id="fb">
    <h2 style="font-size:19px">${x.fbT}</h2>
    <p class="muted">${x.fbP}</p>
    ${fb}
  </section>
  <p class="demo">${x.demo}</p>`;
  lastR=r;kmapObj=null;kakaoMap(r);wireAds(r);wireFood(r);
  s.querySelectorAll("[data-s]").forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{
    state.rating=+b.dataset.s;
    s.querySelectorAll("[data-s]").forEach(o=>o.setAttribute("aria-pressed",String(+o.dataset.s<=state.rating)));
    const sv=document.getElementById("fbSave");if(sv)sv.disabled=false;
  });
  const sv=document.getElementById("fbSave");
  if(sv)sv.onclick=()=>{
    saveReview({stars:state.rating,place:document.getElementById("fbLong").value,nat:state.a.nat,text:document.getElementById("fbText").value.trim().slice(0,200),mine:true});
    state.fbSent=true;renderResult(s,a);document.getElementById("fb").scrollIntoView({block:"center"});
  };
  a.innerHTML=`<button class="btn ghost" id="backBtn" type="button">${x.back}</button><button class="btn" id="againBtn" type="button">${x.again}</button>`;
  document.getElementById("backBtn").onclick=()=>{state.screen="q";state.q=QUESTIONS.length-1;render()};
  document.getElementById("againBtn").onclick=()=>{state={...state,screen:"home",q:0,a:blankA(),ship:null,rating:0,aiText:"",aiNote:"",aiMsg:"",fbSent:false};render()};
}

/* ---------- operator view (Korean only): stay time, reviews, spending patterns ---------- */
function renderOps(s,a){
  const nm=id=>PLACES.find(p=>p.id===id).name.ko.replace(/ \(.*\)/,"");
  const rows=PLACES.map(p=>({id:p.id,plan:p.dwell,act:DWELL[p.id],diff:DWELL[p.id]-p.dwell})).sort((x,y)=>y.diff-x.diff);
  const top=rows[0],low=rows[rows.length-1];
  const maxM=Math.max(...rows.map(r=>Math.max(r.plan,r.act)));
  const avgDiff=Math.round(rows.reduce((n,r)=>n+r.diff,0)/rows.length);
  const mine=loadReviews();
  const allRev=mine.concat(SAMPLE_REVIEWS);
  const avgStars=(allRev.reduce((n,r)=>n+r.stars,0)/allRev.length).toFixed(1);
  const peak=HOURS.reduce((p,h)=>h[1]>p[1]?h:p);
  const maxH=peak[1];
  const natName={ja:"일본",zh:"중국",us:"미국",kr:"한국",tw:"대만",other:"기타"};
  const col={food:"#0d4a5c",cafe:"#7fb3bf",shop:"#e5533b"};
  const topSpend=SPEND.reduce((p,c)=>c.avg>p.avg?c:p);
  s.innerHTML=`
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
    <p class="muted">운영자용 · 체류·후기·소비 분석</p>
    <div class="find">${nm(top.id)}에서 계획보다 ${top.diff}분 더 머물러요</div>
    <p class="muted">추천 동선의 예상 시간과 실제 머문 시간을 비교하면, 사람들이 오래 머무는 곳에 상권을 키울 수 있어요.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="kpis">
    <div class="stat"><div class="n">${avgDiff>0?"+":""}${avgDiff}분</div><div class="l">평균 체류 차이</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="n">${avgStars}</div><div class="l">평균 후기 별점</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="n">${peak[0]}시</div><div class="l">방문 가장 많은 시간</div></div>
  </div>
  <section class="card">
    <h2 style="font-size:19px">장소별 체류시간: 계획 vs 실제</h2>
    <div class="legend"><span><i style="background:var(--buoy)"></i>계획보다 김</span><span><i style="background:var(--sea)"></i>계획보다 짧음</span><span><i style="border:2px solid var(--sea-deep);background:none"></i>계획 시간</span></div>
    <div class="rows">${rows.map(r=>`<div class="drow"><span class="nm">${esc(nm(r.id))}</span><span class="track"><span class="pl" style="width:${r.plan/maxM*100}%"></span><span class="ac ${r.diff>0?"up":""}" style="width:${r.act/maxM*100}%"></span></span><span class="v">${r.diff>0?"+":""}${r.diff}분</span></div>`).join("")}</div>
    <p class="muted">${nm(low.id)}은(는) 계획보다 ${-low.diff}분 짧아요. 볼거리 안내를 보강하거나 동선 시간을 줄여도 돼요.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="card">
    <h2 style="font-size:19px">국적별 1인 평균 지출과 쓰는 곳</h2>
    <div class="legend"><span><i style="background:${col.food}"></i>음식</span><span><i style="background:${col.cafe}"></i>카페</span><span><i style="background:${col.shop}"></i>쇼핑</span></div>
    <div class="rows">${SPEND.map(d=>`<div class="srow"><span>${natName[d.k]}</span><span class="stack" aria-label="음식 ${d.food}%, 카페 ${d.cafe}%, 쇼핑 ${d.shop}%"><span style="width:${d.food}%;background:${col.food}"></span><span style="width:${d.cafe}%;background:${col.cafe}"></span><span style="width:${d.shop}%;background:${col.shop}"></span></span><span class="v" style="text-align:right;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap">${won(d.avg)}</span></div>`).join("")}</div>
    <p class="muted">${natName[topSpend.k]} 승객이 가장 많이 쓰고, 그중 쇼핑 비중이 ${topSpend.shop}%예요.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="card">
    <h2 style="font-size:19px">시간대별 영도 방문 인원</h2>
    <div class="hours">${HOURS.map(h=>`<div><b class="${h===peak?"pk":""}" style="height:${h[1]/maxH*85}%"></b>${h[0]}</div>`).join("")}</div>
    <p class="muted">${peak[0]}시 전후로 몰려요. 식당은 이 시간 전에 준비를 끝내면 좋아요.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="card">
    <h2 style="font-size:19px">최근 후기</h2>
    ${allRev.slice(0,6).map(r=>`<div class="rv"><div class="meta">${"★".repeat(r.stars)}${"☆".repeat(5-r.stars)} · ${esc(nm(r.place))} · ${natName[r.nat]||"기타"}${r.mine?" · 이 기기에서 작성":""}</div>${r.text?esc(r.text):'<span class="muted">별점만 남김</span>'}</div>`).join("")}
  </section>
  <section class="card">
    <h2 style="font-size:19px">그래서 이렇게 해볼 수 있어요</h2>
    <ul class="todo">
      <li>${nm(top.id)}처럼 오래 머무는 곳 주변 가게에 입항일 정보를 먼저 알려요.</li>
      <li>${peak[0]}시 점심 피크 전에 해산물 식당 대기 안내를 앱에 띄워요.</li>
      <li>${natName[topSpend.k]} 승객이 많은 날은 쇼핑 동선(다이소·올리브영·롯데백화점 광복점)을 더 앞에 둬요.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <p class="demo">위 숫자와 예시 후기는 시연용 가상 데이터예요. 실제로는 QR 접속 기록, 후기·체류시간 입력, 카드 결제 통계로 채워요. 이 기기에서 남긴 후기는 맨 위에 함께 보여요.</p>`;
  a.innerHTML=`<button class="btn ghost" id="backBtn" type="button">이전</button><button class="btn" id="homeBtn" type="button">관광객 화면으로</button>`;
  document.getElementById("backBtn").onclick=()=>{state.screen="home";render()};
  document.getElementById("homeBtn").onclick=()=>{state.screen="home";render()};
}

render();
loadCruises();
loadFoods();
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
